Subject: [PATCH 12/12] LeadSearcher: copy a code right from the notification

A monospace fragment of the message (or the Telegram login code) gets its own button in the notification: one click puts it to the clipboard without opening the chat. Custom notifications show the code on the button, Windows toasts get a background action.
